    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="19.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 19.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ lufie man Godes riht heonan forð georne wordes ⁊ dæde; ðonne wurð us eallum Godes miltse ðe gearwre.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And God's law shall henceforth be zealously cherished in word and in deed; then the mercy of God will be granted the more readily to us all.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ lufige Godes riht heonan forð georne wordes ⁊ dæde: ðonne wurð us eallum Godes milts þe gearuwre.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
